{"summary":"Action RPG in metroidvania style.","description":"Runic Curse is a thrilling action RPG Metroidvania that transports you to a cursed island. Explore dark and diverse locations, battle hordes of enemies and mighty bosses. Forge your own playstyle by combining various weapons with magical runes to overcome all challenges.\n\nFeatures:\n- Dynamic combat system.\n- RPG elements: Level-up system with selective stat upgrades, equipment, and abilities to access new areas.\n- Countless ways to combine weapons and magic runes.\n- 10 vast locations filled with varied enemies and bosses.\n- Craft consumable runes and upgrade your weapon runes.\n- Over 55 different spells.\n- Unlimited New Game+.\n- Boss Rush mode.\n\nPortuguese localization: Leonardo Oliveira\nTurkish localization: Dark Zaur","esrbNotes":"Violence, Blood","pegiNotes":"Moderate Violence","iapPrices":null,"video":"https://www.youtube.com/embed/eH2gv784vyM?vq=large&rel=0&autohide=1&showinfo=0","header":"https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/o3slStRfaR_eSJmMbcoiY225_PhXHObiVHQAz1R1piyzMOgHpcWjFVCEDLaz4Fqn1Tgrb49UVO3me8i3iuywiBU","screenshots":["https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/qu_IvXhu4A-fpRK5JD888O1c_cUlnpIkHp_K7vA3lzM_QK-01qKXnzc7LJWULwaLh9xN77RMmK3v6e4sgPqG6g","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/hvp2zTW8PHNXHa5Opik0lLMHUz3LpfxK2Woxqi0-CCXuDQgUTSXr8LCQnNKZchxHCEsNzdCtZ5HLYelT8rmTVSg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/cALQu-UlvZNVY4MWJokBLrzMfwHXs5aGCEF1l2USKmEbCiyzj82VOQjnPViEUzsBerglQJXjrRGFpqZCXL-gzg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/1WgCxYzmCzIlls8oQZ9-OSeIXcqIyFjTVyDuxtS32k34WfAQus45diVwcnqSaCT5iPdijwH07Bjg47wunuzZuA","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/7pfiKMuJk4fC9ceVMouX2c8XB-ZsgKNV5Klqtmxfyd_wWY6wCsCa_PvTmHnj3cA2FC85iFk-wAM_V77qnzH1dJQ","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/uTK5yNmkM2wuFn5CGqw12L5T3D9YJoyCbJ72_1dHRv2eVbynkE7CpB_CwqF5sDGlFKUY1tpnGyGr03pXVWP1tg","https://play-lh.googleusercontent.com/OOGWicK5WiZOh2WgbbdnkE8im9_-N__fcwVG3NHh6rSTwvKtnO1L-df0GNVGzM9ai-u5Tt7V